:: Deadwood Reblooms Bailey Bank Account []
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $location to 'home'>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		You tell Bailey that you have opened a bank account, and offer to use it for the weekly rent.
		<br><br>
		Bailey puts down <<his>> pen. "Useful," <<he>> says, pulling a form from a drawer and sliding it towards you. "Sign this. When the rent is due, the account pays first. If it's short, you cover the rest in cash."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		你告诉贝利自己开了银行账户，并提出以后用账户支付每周租金。
		<br><br>
		贝利放下笔。“有点用。”<<he>>从抽屉里抽出一张表格，推到你面前，“签了。租金到期时先从账户里取，不够的部分你再用现金补上。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink '授权银行扣款' 'Deadwood Reblooms Bailey Bank Account Authorised'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<lanLink '不透露账户' 'Orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Bailey Bank Account Authorised []
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $location to 'home'>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.finance.bank.bailey_knows_account to true>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		You sign the form. Bailey checks it, then files it away. <span class="red">"Good. That removes one excuse."</span>
	<<option 'CN'>>
		你在表格上签了字。贝利检查一遍，把它收进文件里。<span class="red">“很好。这下你又少了一个借口。”</span>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink '返回' 'Orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>
